This license covers the postvec PostgreSQL extension (postvec/), the postvec
command-line tool (postvec-cli/) and their packaging (packaging/postvec/) — the
components published as postvec release artifacts. The same text is the
repository-root LICENSE. postvec-server/ is a separate product under the
Business Source License 1.1; see LICENSING.md for the per-directory index.

Third-party components redistributed alongside postvec keep their own licenses,
which ship in the packages and images that carry them:

  * pgvector                — PostgreSQL License (a package dependency, never
                              vendored)
  * ONNX Runtime            — MIT (postvec-onnxruntime package / local image;
                              see /usr/share/doc/postvec-onnxruntime/)
  * bundled embedding model — see the model package's own LICENSE, NOTICE and
                              SOURCE.json under
                              /usr/share/doc/postvec-model-*/ and
                              /opt/postvec/models/
